WEBVTT

00:00.450 --> 00:03.170
How do you study at INISCH? Let me show you,

00:03.210 --> 00:04.520
step by step.

00:05.170 --> 00:08.330
Not sure where to start? Take the quiz.

00:08.370 --> 00:09.850
It's eight questions.

00:09.890 --> 00:12.360
Two minutes. And no sign-up.

00:13.010 --> 00:15.410
Want to get to know the System first? Watch

00:15.450 --> 00:16.890
the free mini-course:

00:16.930 --> 00:19.960
five short lessons with Isabel Elizalde.

00:20.530 --> 00:22.850
Then you choose your program.

00:22.890 --> 00:25.330
There are three, and they're independent.

00:25.370 --> 00:28.330
They aren't steps: each one is for someone

00:28.370 --> 00:29.560
different.

00:30.130 --> 00:33.090
The way in is the Intensive Workshop.

00:33.130 --> 00:35.730
Two days. In person and online.

00:35.770 --> 00:37.560
No prerequisites.

00:38.210 --> 00:40.623
There you work through five movements:

00:40.663 --> 00:42.410
the conscious observer,

00:42.450 --> 00:44.250
your film, control,

00:44.290 --> 00:46.090
expectation and attachment,

00:46.130 --> 00:47.530
authentic forgiveness,

00:47.570 --> 00:49.080
and Real Love.

00:49.650 --> 00:51.450
And these are not lectures.

00:51.490 --> 00:53.690
They're exercises in pairs and trios,

00:53.730 --> 00:56.680
where you recognize yourself as you listen to others.

00:57.250 --> 00:59.637
With your enrollment you get into the Student Portal:

00:59.677 --> 01:01.250
your lessons with progress tracking,

01:01.290 --> 01:04.010
My Film, the Journal and the practice

01:04.050 --> 01:05.640
of Fine Attention.

01:06.290 --> 01:08.690
Want to accompany others? The Specialist

01:08.730 --> 01:12.090
Diploma is eight months of methodology,

01:12.130 --> 01:13.960
practice and supervision.

01:14.610 --> 01:16.570
And when you complete any program,

01:16.610 --> 01:18.890
you receive the Institute's certificate,

01:18.930 --> 01:20.760
with a verifiable folio number.

01:21.330 --> 01:23.730
INISCH. Write to us on WhatsApp,

01:23.770 --> 01:26.760
and we'll help you find where to start.
